          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us raise awareness about the issues related to river and ocean pollution by composing a poem. A few lines have been written here, add more lines—",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.17,
            0.563,
            0.254
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Piece of plastic in my neck, As in pain I cry, Koilas, Koilas…where are you dear? Papa fish cries and Mama fish has tears."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.566,
            0.19,
            0.704,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 2,
              "bbox": [
                0.566,
                0.19,
                0.704,
                0.262
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_10_image_2.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.315,
            0.543,
            0.358
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Aware of the harm, yet they let it flow, Koilas faintly hears mother’s sorrow,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.382,
            0.47,
            0.425
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Stop plastic pollution at source, Rivers are our huge resource."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.571,
            0.375,
            0.732,
            0.446
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.571,
