        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.281,
            0.5,
            0.579,
            0.521
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Discuss with your parents"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.135,
            0.526,
            0.706,
            0.612
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A bowl of milk in your home has gone sour. Discuss with your parents how you can use it in another way. Also, which method of separation will you use in the process?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.636,
            0.559,
            0.698
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Malli and Valli take blessings from their Dada and Dadi, bid goodbye to Balan and travel to Madhya Pradesh."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.698,
            0.553,
            0.885
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The train reaches Bhopal in Madhya Pradesh. The sun is rising and it is getting hot. On their way to Maasi’s (maternal aunt’s) home, they drink chhach (buttermilk) in the dhaba (roadside eatery). Malli asks the shopkeeper about the big painting, hanging on the wall of the dhaba. The shopkeeper explains that the picture shows a lady performing"
            }
          ]
        },
